text = "Click to look around, Esc to let go of the mouse. WASD walk.
Space call the Arm / let go, A / D while held: next Station left / right.
At Navigation: plot the Course: J / L heading -/+ 15 deg, pitch 1 dive, 2 level, 3 climb,
Z / X  -/+ 15 deg; P pulse, Q Quiet Ship.
At the Drive Station: T / G power +/- 10%, Y / H steering effort +/- 10%;
the Course keys there override the Course, O back to the Course.
At the Bore Station: F observe the next feature in the Column (slow down to record it),
U which survey goes up the link first, B stop / start the link.
At the Thermal Station: C / V send heat outward / into the Column; stranded, they run the pumps on the store to cool the hull.
Hold K at Thermal for three seconds: self-destruct; K again cancels it.
At the Reactor: N / M turn the dial onto the plasma's wobble, R to Shift;
stranded, I relights the Head from the emergency store.
. time faster (only while no Station calls), , normal.
Enter: rebuy after hull failure, or start another dive.
F1 these controls, F3 developer debug overlay."
